<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #F59E0B; color: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
    .body { background: #fff; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .amount { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #DC2626; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0; }
    .details { background: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; }
    .details dt { font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 8px; }
    .details dd { margin: 2px 0 0 0; }
    .info { background: #DBEAFE; border: 1px solid #BFDBFE; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px; margin: 16px 0; color: #1E40AF; }
    .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; margin-top: 24px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }
    .footer a { color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Dispute Opened</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hello{{#if payerName}} {{payerName}}{{/if}},</p>
      <div class="info">
        <strong>Dispute Received:</strong> Your dispute has been successfully opened and is being processed.
      </div>
      <dl class="details">
        <dt>Dispute ID</dt>
        <dd>{{disputeId}}</dd>
        <dt>Payment ID</dt>
        <dd>{{paymentId}}</dd>
        <dt>Disputed Amount</dt>
        <dd>{{paymentAmount}} {{paymentCurrency}}</dd>
        {{#if disputeReason}}<dt>Reason</dt>
        <dd>{{disputeReason}}{{/if}}
      </dl>
      <p>We will review your dispute and notify you of any updates. This process typically takes 5-10 business days.</p>
      <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="{{appUrl}}/disputes/{{disputeId}}" style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">View Dispute Status</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} FacilPay. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p><a href="{{appUrl}}">FacilPay Dashboard</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>